# Cloud Build / gcloud run deploy --source upload filter. Run the deploy from the REPO ROOT with
#   gcloud run deploy leaderboard --source . --region asia-south1   (and --project fluffy-climbers-tower-jump)
# only after the owner approved a cloud change. This file keeps the upload to what the service needs.
# The service links Assets/_Game/{Simulation,Content,Economy} sources and Assets/Resources/Content/content_manifest.json: keep those.
.git/
.gitignore
Library/
Logs/
Temp/
UserSettings/
Art/
Content/assets/
Content/golden/
Planning/
Item List to do/
docs/
Packages/
ProjectSettings/
Tests/
Tools/*
!Tools/leaderboard_service/
Tools/leaderboard_service/bin/
Tools/leaderboard_service/obj/
Assets/Art/
Assets/Plugins/
Assets/Editor/
Assets/StreamingAssets/
Assets/_Game/Gameplay/
Assets/_Game/UI/
Assets/_Game/Audio/
Assets/_Game/Tests/
Assets/Resources/Art/
Assets/Resources/Audio/
Assets/Resources/Fonts/
*.whl
*.tar.gz
*.apk
*.aab
*.md
